      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Of the three installers I contacted, the guys at Renewture were the only ones to come out and do a face to face  sales phase (not just via phone and email). They spent the time to review our current solar set up, crunch the numbers from our power bills and come up with some suitable options for an appropriately sized battery that would integrate with our existing solar system and suit our needs.On the day of installation the team arrived on time as arranged. The installation itself was done in a neat, tidy and professional manner. In the days following the installation the guys from Renewture contacted me to see how the system is operating and to find out if I had any questions.Overall, I found the guys from Renewture to be honest and reliable. I would have no hesitation in recommending or using their services again.",
