      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Late last year we sought a number of quotes through SolarQuotes to upgrade our ageing 15-year-old 3KWH solar system. Although our system was still working despite a few cracks in our panels, we were concerned about the number of power outages on the grid and the hotter, and more humid weather conditions that we are likely to experience as the world warms.We also wanted to save money and were a bit jerked off about declining solar feed-in tariffs. That meant we needed a bigger system linked to a battery,In the end we went with a local company Renewture. Peter from Renewture responded immediately to our enquiry and within a few days had visited our property, checked out requirements and given us a quote.We arranged for an 8kW Solar + 9.6kWh Battery System that was installed three weeks later.The installation was extremely efficient and went off with little fuss.We can’t speak too highly of the professionalism of Peter and his team.One week later Peter returned to see that all was in order and sat with us for several hours explaining how we could get the most from the system.The system works perfectly, we can monitor our usage minute to minute via an app and since the system was installed we have drawn zero energy from the grid. The battery supplies us energy at night and in the event of a grid outage. The battery is usually fully recharged by 9.30am each day. Couldn’t be happier.",
